  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Zlash3.jpg\" title=\"Z'lash (and potential victim)\"><img alt=\"Z'lash (and potential victim)\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"314\" src=\"/images/Zlash3.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Zlash3.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Z'lash (and potential victim)</div></div></div>\n<p>Z'lash is a giant barbarian <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Champions\" title=\"Category:Champions\">Champion</a> who attacks with a huge axe, or perhaps a musical instrument, depending on your point of view..  He is found someplace in <a href=\"/wiki/Z'lash's_Pad\" title=\"Z'lash's Pad\">Z'lash's Pad</a> off Level 1 of <a href=\"/wiki/Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"Mutanous Malaise\">Mutanous Malaise</a>.  He is not that hard to defeat and only drops medium loot.  In Z'lash's Pad are at least two other Heroes who are tougher and drop more loot.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
